.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt THREAD_EXIT 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm thread_exit
.Nd terminate the calling thread
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft void
.Fn thread_exit "int code"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
system call terminates only the calling thread.
The process stays alive while it owns other threads; when the last thread exits, the process
terminates with
.Fa code
exactly as if it had called
.Xr exit 2 .
.Pp
Use
.Xr exit 2
to terminate the whole process, or
.Xr proc_terminate 2
to terminate another process as an authorized caller.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn thread_exit
does not return.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr exit 2 ,
.Xr proc_terminate 2 ,
.Xr thread_create 2
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
